{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f265d58bea8cadf9068036692e01bfa54e605f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> is used as an approximation to the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cf938da9a6f1372d308ec4d297c3e73e21c7387.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{1 + y}, |y| &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"105\" height=\"40\" />, the ratio of the error made to the correct value is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c64536f23ae9d7dabdc539fcd2237b112026c3ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ y^2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ \\frac {1}{1 + y} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ \\frac{y}{1+y}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ \\frac{y^2}{1+y}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"488\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The error made in this approximation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8ef775c8ed4ebc82f301fc59aad55b7cb78d94e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+y}-(1-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"124\" height=\"42\" />, and the correct value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16cda891b92caeb367549463072e3d772cd76ff5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"47\" height=\"42\" />. Taking the ratio of these two values, we have:\n\\begin{align*} \\\\\n\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+y}-(1-y)}{\\frac{1}{1+y}}&amp;=\\frac{[\\frac{1}{1+y}-(1-y)][1+y]}{[\\frac{1}{1+y}][1+y]} \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{1-(1-y^2)}{1} \\\\\n&amp;=y^2 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f82e3a92d88f35cdfe507b97d02ca196bda6a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" 